  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial management/accounts support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is assisting the HUMCIV unit with timely review of the most urgent (aging and complex) financial accounts as well as preparation of input to accounting notes to avoid an increasing back log of a very large portfolio of accounts, including many complex multilateral accounts. The support will assist and improve flow in operations and increase the ability to perform timely financial monitoring and compliance (particularly at a time where HCE existing financial management specialist, CFO, and other ressources are allocated to the last reviews of strategic partners and after the team has been undermanned and without a teamleader for a significant amount of time).</narrative>
  </description>
